dtmail: build for SVR4.

- RoamApp.C, DtMailServer.C, RFCMailBox.C, RFCTransport.C: struct
  sigaction's sa_handler is void (*)() in an SVR4.0 header; assign through
  the member's own type.
- RFCMailBox.C: an SVR4 signal handler takes int, as on AIX and Linux.
- DtMailRc.C: the system mailrc is /usr/share/lib/mailx/mailx.rc, SVR4
  mailx's.
- dmx.hh: SVR4's <sys/types.h> defines boolean_t.

--- a/programs/dtmail/dtmail/RoamApp.C	2026-11-20 12:03:13
+++ b/programs/dtmail/dtmail/RoamApp.C	2026-11-20 12:03:13
@@ -957,7 +957,8 @@
 
 nl_catd DT_catd = (nl_catd) -1;    // catgets file descriptor
 
-#define SA_HANDLER_TYPE void (*)(int)
+/* the handler member's own type: void (*)(int), or void (*)() in SVR4's struct sigaction */
+#define SA_HANDLER_TYPE decltype(((struct sigaction *)0)->sa_handler)
 
 void RoamApp::initialize(int *argcp, char **argv)
 {
